## Brand assets are not covered by the MIT license

The grant above applies to the source code only. It does not license the
Boundfox Studios brand: the name, the wordmarks, the fox-head mark, the app
and game logos, the key art and every other image under
`projects/website/branding/` and `projects/website/public/`. Those assets
remain the property of Boundfox Studios and may not be reused, redistributed
or modified without written permission.

The bundled web fonts are likewise outside the MIT grant and stay under their
own terms: Barlow and Bebas Neue under the SIL Open Font License, whose texts
ship next to the font files in `projects/website/public/fonts/`, and Tahu
under the terms set by its author.
